        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Help Zealot find her lost brother, Solitude, in the vibrant but chaotic ‘Other Dimension’ where riches are abundant and dangers aplenty!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game rolls roguelite and run and gunner into a tight experience with 1-4 couch co-op.  Combine bullet powers found on the field to create unique bullet types. Dash to avoid attacks but also to crash enemies or deflect bullets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through randomised levels, challenge large bullet hell-like bosses and collect Red Eye Orbs to spend between attempts to permanently upgrade your abilities to help tip the tide and assist you in beating the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Powers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can pick up a maximum of 3 bullet powers to create unique shooting effects. Find bullet powers dropped by destroyed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomised Levels:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have 3 minutes to run down the snake winding levels before it starts exploding behind them! There are few detours, encouraging less exploration but more pace on running through the levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of a set of biome levels there are bullet-hell like bosses to act as gatekeepers to further biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies, Traps and Ambushes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On randomised levels, there are a number of enemies with unique fighting styles, traps such as mines and even ambushes where a unit of enemies will spawn around the players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Red Eye Orbs and Crystals to purchase upgrades to your characters stats, unlock abilities and unlock shortcuts after defeating bosses. Do you purchasing at the hub world before jumping back into the action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temporary Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose 1 of 3 randomly selected upgrades. These will disappear on death, so choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>can you crash, smash and dash you're way through the Other Dimension to save your brother?</i></strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Help Zealot find her lost brother, Solitude, in the vibrant but chaotic ‘Other Dimension’ where riches are abundant and dangers aplenty!</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game rolls roguelite and run and gunner into a tight experience with 1-4 couch co-op.  Combine bullet powers found on the field to create unique bullet types. Dash to avoid attacks but also to crash enemies or deflect bullets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through randomised levels, challenge large bullet hell-like bosses and collect Red Eye Orbs to spend between attempts to permanently upgrade your abilities to help tip the tide and assist you in beating the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Powers:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can pick up a maximum of 3 bullet powers to create unique shooting effects. Find bullet powers dropped by destroyed enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomised Levels:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players have 3 minutes to run down the snake winding levels before it starts exploding behind them! There are few detours, encouraging less exploration but more pace on running through the levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of a set of biome levels there are bullet-hell like bosses to act as gatekeepers to further biomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies, Traps and Ambushes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On randomised levels, there are a number of enemies with unique fighting styles, traps such as mines and even ambushes where a unit of enemies will spawn around the players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Red Eye Orbs and Crystals to purchase upgrades to your characters stats, unlock abilities and unlock shortcuts after defeating bosses. Do you purchasing at the hub world before jumping back into the action!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Temporary Upgrades:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each level, choose 1 of 3 randomly selected upgrades. These will disappear on death, so choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>can you crash, smash and dash you're way through the Other Dimension to save your brother?</i></strong></p>",
        "short_description": "This game rolls roguelite and run and gunner into a tight experience with 1-4 couch co-op. Combine bullet powers found on the field to create unique bullet types. Dash to avoid attacks but also to crash enemies or deflect bullets.",
